sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Browser
    participant Server as studies.cs.helsinki.fi

    User->>Browser: Write a note and click Save
    Browser->>Server: POST /exampleapp/new_note<br/>Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded<br/>note=New+note
    Server->>Server: Store note with its creation date
    Server-->>Browser: 302 Found<br/>Location: /exampleapp/notes
    Browser->>Server: GET /exampleapp/notes
    Server-->>Browser: HTML document
    Browser->>Server: GET /exampleapp/main.css
    Server-->>Browser: CSS stylesheet
    Browser->>Server: GET /exampleapp/main.js
    Server-->>Browser: JavaScript file
    Note right of Browser: Execute JavaScript to fetch notes
    Browser->>Server: GET /exampleapp/data.json
    Server-->>Browser: Notes as JSON, including the new note
    Browser->>Browser: Render notes on the page
    Browser-->>User: Display the updated notes